		+ "shown the same way, and opens the Overview page once it validates"
	WAVE @WAVE.13
	RATIONALE "The save manager holds the loaded save in memory only, so a reader coming back to a"
		+ "save picks its file again. A save weighs about 2 MB, beyond what the browser's key-value"
		+ "storage holds for five saves, hence a browser database; nothing reaches the server. The"
		+ "saves carry the real names of the players, so nothing is kept until the reader asks for"
		+ "it by a button, never by a modal opening on its own, and a refusal leaves nothing to"
		+ "record. Loading a kept save again takes the path of a picked file, so no second load"
		+ "path exists. The storage this task builds is the one FIX152 needs to survive a reload,"
		+ "and the one FEAT153 clears and FEAT154 bounds in time"
