	AFTER @TASK.REFACTOR161
	AFTER @TASK.REFACTOR160
	WAVE @WAVE.14
	DELIVERED_BY 236
	PRIORITY high
	DESC "fixes violations 5, 10 and 13 of the audit"
	RATIONALE "The three violations are one boundary, the decoding of the save text: violation 10"
		+ "replaces what the serializer would otherwise split on, and violation 13 moves the shape"
		+ "checks to where the text is decoded. The id lists of inventories and world objects"
		+ "already cross the boundary as arrays; what is left is the records themselves, imported"
		+ "by the merge rules and the save types, the unlocked groups mergeGlobalMetadata splits"
		+ "and joins, and the empty planet PlayerEntity reads. The save format has no escape: the"
		+ "parser splits the text on @, so the separator is replaced, not escaped, by the module"
		+ "that joins the sections, in shared-save-processing, which owns serialization. Replacing"
		+ "every @ of an entry rather than the display name alone keeps any field from splitting"
		+ "the save; measured on the eight private reference saves, none carries a @ inside a"
		+ "section, so no real save changes by a byte. The shape checks leave the domain because"
		+ "the instructions rule domain_error_business_meaning and the recorded decisions already"
		+ "place a broken invariant at decoding, after validation refused what it could: nothing"
		+ "catches InvalidSaveDataError today. The task follows the domain rules task, which takes"
		+ "the unique host rule out of the game-definitions allow-list and touches the reader"
		+ "adapter, so the two would otherwise conflict. No committed save is public and the"
		+ "scenario fixtures are generated at each run, so the text written is compared between the"
		+ "branch and its base on those, the reviewer replaying the command"
		REF @TASK.REFACTOR160
		REF @DECISION.SharedSaveProcessingOwnsSectionParsingAndSerialization
	SOURCE "Owner ruling on the Clean Architecture audit of 2026-09-28"
		PR 222
	SOURCE "Owner ruling during the refinement of CHORE158: the domain defines a business type per"
		+ "save section instead of importing the save format records"
	SOURCE "Owner ruling during the refinement of the task: the serializer of"
		+ "shared-save-processing replaces every @ of an entry, the task follows the domain rules"
		+ "task, and the written text is compared on the scenario fixtures"

