		+ "releases table in a data- package behind a port, and the decoding, which rewrites the"
		+ "merge rules that read the releases. Comparing two releases needs no table; resolving a"
		+ "declared version and naming the current game release read the rows, so the adapter hands"
		+ "them to the use case, which gives them to the rule. The current game release, the last"
		+ "row of the table, is not the current save format, the first release writing eleven"
		+ "parts: the constant that carried both names is split. The contradiction warning leaves"
		+ "the parser because it resolves a declared version, a business judgement the domain now"
